				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Colendissime frater, tuas omni pietate et humanitate <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>plenas accepi hic <placeName ref="l513">Ulmę</placeName> 25. iunii,<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Der Brief ist nicht erhalten.</note> et doluit sane vehementer, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quod in commendando vere nobili viro d. <persName ref="p3559">Hartmanno a Hallwyl</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>tuis votis respondere, ut maxime voluerim, non potuerim, etsi mea <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>commendatio et opera, quam praecipue tibi debeo, admodum sit parva.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Tamen, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>quod potui, feci; nam alioqui omnibus haud dubie piis et doctis commendatum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>commendavi <persName ref="p467">Bucero</persName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p1055">Frechts</persName> Schreiben an <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> ist ebenfalls verloren.</note> adhuc <placeName ref="l410">Ratisponę</placeName> herenti<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> hielt sich am längsten von allen namhaften protestantischen Theologen beim <placeName ref="l410">Regensburger</placeName> Reichstag auf; vgl. <hi>Ortmann,</hi> Reformation 262 mit Anm. 181.</note>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Verum cum in isto temporis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>articulo noster <persName ref="p8011">Rudolphus</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p8011">Rudolf Gwalther</persName>.</note> et me salutaret et valediceret, rogans eum, num <lb xml:id="p1z9"/><placeName ref="l410">Ratisbonę</placeName> illum <persName ref="p3559">nobilem</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p3559">Hartmann von Hallwyl</persName>.</note> vidisset, respondit nihil prorsus sibi de eo constare.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Est autem octavus hodie dies, quando nobilis ille huc venit et postridie hinc <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>solvit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ceterum et temporis et argumenti inopia laborans ad te nunc <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nihil rescribere potui et nolui quidem hunc satis facundum tabellionem<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Unbekannt.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>suo fraudere officio, qui mea viva erit ad<pb type="edition" next="240"/> te epistola, unde cognosces, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>quid interea sit <placeName ref="l410">Ratisponę</placeName> actum.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Vere ille de conventuum eventu scripsit s<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>e raro aliquem vidisse foelicem<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p1055">Frecht</persName> scheint hier zu einer ihm von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> mitgeteilten Äußerung Stellung zu nehmen.</note>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Dominus pacis ecclesiam suam in pace, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quam mundus dare nequit,<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Joh 14, 27</ref></cit>.</note> gubernet et conservet.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p540">Calvinus</persName> 20. <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>iunii ex <placeName ref="l410">Ratisbona</placeName> huc redierat et postridie mox hinc solvebat<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Zu <persName ref="p540">Calvins</persName> Reisestationen nach dem <placeName ref="l410">Regensburger</placeName> Reichstag s. oben <ref target="file11583">Nr. 1540</ref>, Anm. 11.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Qui hoc, quod maxime scire cupiebam, boni nuncii narrabat <placeName ref="l726">Superioris <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Germanię</placeName> ecclesias arctius nunc copulatas quam unquam; dei enim perpetua <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>gratia unanimiter illud cesareum scriptum<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Das <placeName ref="l410">Regensburger</placeName> Buch; vgl. dazu oben <ref target="file11566">Nr. 1523</ref> mit Anm. 31 und 33, sowie die protestantische Antwort in <bibl source="b441">MO</bibl> IV, Nr. 2300-2302.</note> nobis displicuit et reiectus <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>articulus de transsubstantiatione<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Vgl. <persName ref="p540">Calvins</persName> Briefe an <persName ref="p1049">Guillaume Farel</persName> vom Mai 1541 in <bibl>CO</bibl> XI, <ref target="file10339">Nr. 308</ref>f, sowie oben <ref target="file11563">Nr. 1520</ref>, 8f mit Anm. 5 und <ref target="file11566">Nr. 1523</ref>, 99-103 mit Anm. 46.</note> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">De <persName ref="p467">Bucero</persName>, quod et me angebat <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>maxime, <persName ref="p540">Calvinus</persName> quoque narrabat per omnia bene ei cum reliquis <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>fratribus convenire, etsi nunc subodorer nescio quas singulares deliberationes <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>illum habuisse<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Zu <persName ref="p467">Bucers</persName> Haltung in <placeName ref="l410">Regensburg</placeName> s. <hi>Ortmann,</hi> Reformation 241-265, zu den gegen ihn gerichteten Verdächtigungen bes. S. 257f.</note>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Scit <persName ref="p540">Calvinus</persName>, quam oportune importune<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>2Tim 4,2</ref></cit>.</note> <placeName ref="l410">Ratisponę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><persName ref="p467">Bucerum</persName> monuerim, obtestatus fuerim, ut non nimium indulgeret conciliationibus<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> war sich durchaus der Kritik der Protestanten an seiner Versöhnungspolitik bewusst und rechtfertigte sein Verhalten in einem Brief an <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> vom 13. August; vgl. <bibl source="b51">Blarer BW</bibl> II 79-81.</note>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Verum temporis angustia excludor nunc de iis et aliis scribendo.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Obtestatus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><persName ref="p540">Calvinum</persName> sum, ut, quia me diutius <placeName ref="l410">Ratisponę</placeName> heserat,<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><persName ref="p540">Calvin</persName> reiste wohl am 16. Juni aus <placeName ref="l410">Regensburg</placeName> ab, <persName ref="p1055">Frecht</persName> war schon vorher aufgebrochen; vgl. oben <ref target="file11583">Nr. 1540</ref> mit Anm. 11.</note> ad vos scriberet.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Sed <persName ref="p3559">grammatophorus</persName> iste<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16"><persName ref="p3559">Hartmann von Hallwyl</persName>.</note> reliqua exponet vobis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale cum dom<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>inis et fratribus symmystis observandis, quos et nostri cupiunt salvos me<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>cumque petunt vestris precibus commendati esse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l513">Ulmę</placeName>, raptim, 2. iulii 1541.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Parce tam ruditer effusę magis <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>quam scriptę epistolę, quam relegere <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>non potui.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Tuus ex animo <persName ref="p1055">M. <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>Frechtus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Egregie docto et pio d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię fidelissimo <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ministro, domino colendo et charissimo fratri.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
